            "code": "\t\n\tmsg \u003d None\n\tif value[\u0027itemInfo\u0027][\u0027itemId\u0027] is None: msg \u003d \u0027This part does not exist in MES\u0027\n\telif len(value[\u0027lots\u0027][\u0027lotOptions\u0027]) \u003d\u003d 0: msg \u003d \u0027No lots found for this part\u0027\n\telif len(value[\u0027lots\u0027][\u0027lotOptions\u0027]) \u003e 0 and value[\u0027lots\u0027][\u0027index\u0027] is None: msg \u003d \u0027No lot selected\u0027\n\t\n\treturn {\u0027msg\u0027: msg}",
